Your turn. Say it with me. While AI brings efficiency, it also raises ethical concerns.

15
00:01:45.721 --> 00:02:07.369
Artificial intelligence is transforming society at a rapid pace, with automation powered by complex algorithms reshaping entire industries. While AI brings efficiency and innovation, it also raises ethical concerns about jobs, privacy, and fairness. Many governments are now considering regulation to manage its impact responsibly.

